# YAGNI

1. Reuse `resources.ts`, public-forms pipeline, sanitize, supabase helpers.
2. Use existing deps (fetch Resend, Turnstile helpers, Vitest).
3. Minimum new code in the correct layer.
4. New dependency/vendor only with explicit approval.

Never cut: validation, tests, a11y basics, RLS/auth, honest errors.

Reject: second auth, Payload, Redux/Zustand for this site, growing `QuoteForm.tsx`, fabricated trust content, speculative i18n/bookings/members.
